{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "两点间的直线斜率计算与意义",
    "goals": [
      "掌握两点间斜率的计算公式并得出斜率为 3",
      "理解斜率代表“横坐标每增加 1，纵坐标增加多少”的几何变化率"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "开门见山给出答案，满足学生直接要求",
        "逐步比较变化量 Δx 与 Δy，结合图像展示变化率本质"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 1,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "点A横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.025
        }
      },
      {
        "as": "number_02",
        "initial": 3,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "点B横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.025
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "直接计算两点 (1,2) 与 (3,8) 的斜率并用变化量解释几何原因",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "好，直接给结论：过点 (1,2) 和 (3,8) 的直线斜率是 3。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "两点间的直线斜率计算与意义",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{8 - 2}{3 - 1} = \\frac{6}{2} = 3"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "直接展示斜率计算公式与结果",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "为什么是 3？我们把两点连成直线，先比较两个方向的变化量：从点 (1,2) 移动到点 (3,8)，横坐标 x 从 1 增加到 3，增加了 2；纵坐标 y 从 2 增加到 8，增加了 6。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": 0,
                    "max": 5,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -5,
                    "max": 20,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((3)*(x))-(1)",
                    "label": "y = 3x - 1"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "moving-point",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 2,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "second-point",
                    "x": 3,
                    "y": 8,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.y",
                    "expression": "((3)*(number_01))-(1)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_02"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.y",
                    "expression": "((3)*(number_02))-(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "两点变化量",
                "items": [
                  "横向变化量 \\Delta x = 3 - 1 = 2",
                  "纵向变化量 \\Delta y = 8 - 2 = 6",
                  "斜率 k = \\Delta y / \\Delta x = 3"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "斜率本质上就是两个变化量的比值，代表横坐标每增加 1，纵坐标增加多少。横坐标增加 2 时纵坐标共增加了 6，平均每增加 1，纵坐标就稳稳上升 3，所以斜率等于 3。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦变化量比值的几何含义",
              "when": "before_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "过 (1,2) 和 (3,8) 的直线斜率为 3。斜率就是纵向变化量除以横向变化量，表示横坐标每增加 1，纵坐标就相应增加 3。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
